\b Eyal Espresso Firmware Revision History\b0\par
\par
\b Current Version\b0\par
0.1.7\par
\par
\b Latest Version Feature List\b0\par
- ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3b-Box hardware initialization (RGB LCD + GT911 touch).\par
- LVGL 9.x display and input integration.\par
- Demo-based LVGL porting layer imported from `08_lvgl_Porting` and adapted to project layout.\par
- Demo-style RGB panel timing/alignment fields applied in hardware initialization.\par
- Basic Brew Control UI with on-screen toggle and state label.\par
- Build/flash workflow helper with commit + sub-version prompt.\par
- Project migrated from devcontainer workflow to local ESP-IDF workflow.\par
- Stable RGB display recipe validated for the first UI-stable release.\par
- Dark tab-based UI with swipe-left and swipe-right page navigation.\par
- Dedicated requirements and design document template added to the repository.\par
\par
\b Revision Sections (Grouped by X.Y)\b0\par
\par
\b X=0, Y=0\b0\par
\b 2026-03-05\b0\par
- Version: 0.0.Z\par
- Summary: Removed devcontainer assets and switched project setup/docs to local environment usage.\par
- Notes: Updated VS Code settings to workspace-relative build paths and removed `/opt/esp` assumptions.\par
\par
